<title>HONG KONG: ABN-AMRO Bank Shanghai completes US$30 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>ABN-AMRO Bank Shanghai completes US$30 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN-AMRO Bank NV, acting through its Shanghai branch, has completed a US$30 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue, arranger Chase Manhattan Asia said.</p>
<p>The issue has a tenor of five years. It is rated Aa1 by Moody's Investors Service and AA by Standard and Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>Chase and DKB Asia were mandated as arrangers and lead managers. ABN-AMRO Hoare Govett also joined as an arranger and lead manager.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
